  "system": {
    "identifier": "overcomer",
    "description": "<p>Your weapon, your will and your drive are all that you have and you have learned to tap into them simultaneously, at will.</p>\n<p>For the duration, if you would make a Strength saving throw you gain a +1d4 bonus to the roll.</p>\n<p>Additionally, while your hit points are at half or less, at the beginning of each turn you gain 10 Temporary hit points and effects that would move you against your will fail. If the effect to move you occurs before or after damage, the damage is still applied if applicable, but you are not moved.</p>",
